From f217abf2c80c846ddbec621c782aed119f2e82c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gl11tchy <gl11tchy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 01:30:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): add the Sigil Neon TUI theme
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A neutral near-black ground with two neon hues — mint for the agent's own
voice and success, cyan for anything in motion — and nothing in between.
The greys stay neutral so saturation only ever lands on the marks that
carry state.

- theme/sigil.rs: the palette, registered as ThemeKind::SigilNeon
- assets/sigil-neon.tmTheme: the matching syntax theme
- theme/cache.rs: GROK_THEME picks the theme, so a host app can theme the
  window it draws into without rewriting the user's config
- Theme::logo_shine: the welcome logo's shine sweeps toward a themed
  colour instead of primary text
